# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THE ONLY THING YOU NEED TO CHANGE.
#
# One or more Ethereum mainnet RPC URLs, comma-separated.
# The first is used; the rest are automatic fallbacks if it fails.
#
# A free tier from any of these is more than enough:
#   Alchemy  https://www.alchemy.com      https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
#   Infura   https://www.infura.io        https://mainnet.infura.io/v3/YOUR_KEY
#   Ankr     https://www.ankr.com         https://rpc.ankr.com/eth/YOUR_KEY
#   drpc     https://drpc.org             https://lb.drpc.org/ogrpc?network=ethereum&dkey=YOUR_KEY
#
# The provider must support eth_getLogs over a ~350k block range. All of the
# above do on their free tier. Unauthenticated public RPCs generally do NOT.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
